            "id": "PRRC_kwDOThd_Gc7aExYx",
            "body": "I believe current lodestar's payload production path is intended for self build only. So the fee recipient is set to proposer\nhttps://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar/blob/8fc4e297d236b24dab7f94b124793b2770819ad5/packages/beacon-node/src/chain/produceBlock/produceBlockBody.ts#L409\nwhich is bad because this means execution rewards go to the proposer and not builder, and builder also offers bid rewards to proposer based on execution rewards value. So builder is doing charity here.\n\nYou need to have builder's fee recipient in the config, some sort of registration mechanism for that and use it in the payload production path. \n\nI think we might need to modify `getExecutionPayloadBid` spec (not sure) to add fee recipient param so BN knows when building the payload cc. @nflaig",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-27T15:41:00Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-27T15:57:44Z",
            "author": {
              "login": "ensi321"
            }
