          {
            "id": "PRRC_kwDOThd_Gc7aGAZC",
            "body": "I haven't reviewed this in detail, but yes, vanilla lodestar beacon node will not work for now, there are certain tweaks needed to make this work e2e.\r\n\r\nIt might be simpler to produce both the bid and the payload outside of the beacon node, that is what buildoor is doing, but I really like the idea that the beacon node does most of the work and the builder is a leightweight sidecar you can just run alongside. I haven't read this in detail, but the design I had in mind doesn't even require the builder to connect to the execution layer client at all, which I personally like.\r\n\r\n\r\nbut this is a good heads up, neither the beacon-api nor lodestar beacon node currently will work by default for this, there are (hopefully minor) tweaks needed",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-27T16:21:48Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-27T16:22:39Z",
            "author": {
              "login": "nflaig"
            }
